# This repo is a skill source. Pushed content is WHITELISTED: skills/,
# personal-extensions/, and scripts/ (the curation verifier). Everything
# else is local to this machine and never pushed.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/skills
!/personal-extensions
!/scripts

# Dependency installs inside whitelisted directories (e.g. poteto-mode's script
# bootstrap runs `bun install` into its scripts directory) are never pushed.
node_modules/

# Artifacts of installing skills INTO this repo — this repo is a skill source,
# so `npx skills add` should only ever be run against it, not inside it.
# (Redundant under the whitelist, kept as guard rails if it is ever relaxed.)
.agents/
skills-lock.json
